    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Validate and settle a matched order pair \\xe2\\x80\\x94 trustlessly.\\n\\nInstead of trusting the relayer's revealed prices, the relayer supplies a\\nGroth16 `match_proof`. The MatchProof circuit proves, in zero knowledge, that\\nboth commitments open to real orders, the clearing price lies within both\\nlimit prices, the fill is within both committed quantities, and\\n`usdc_amount = floor(xlm_amount * clearing_price / 1e6)`.\\n\\nPublic signals (verified against the on-chain MatchVk):\\n[buyer_commitment, seller_commitment, clearing_price, xlm_amount, usdc_amount]\\nThis contract binds those signals to the orders it settles, so a valid proof\\ncannot be replayed against different orders or amounts.\\n\\nv1: requires relayer_1 auth (chooses WHICH crossing pairs to match).\\nv2: upgrade to 2-of-3 threshold multisig.",
      "name": "submit_match",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "buyer_commitment",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 32
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "seller_commitment",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 32
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
